              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashatse kwambuka ngo ajye muri Akaya bene Data baramukomeza, bandikira abigishwa ngo bamwakire. Na we asohoyeyo, ubuntu bw'Imana bumutera gufasha cyane abizeye, ",
